---

export interface Props {
    colorName: string;
    lightOrDark: "light" | "dark";
}

const { colorName, lightOrDark } = Astro.props;

---
<p>However, this is not a great choice of color pairs, because <code>{colorName}</code> is a shade too close to {lightOrDark} colors.</p>
<ul>
    <li>At best, your content will be tiring to read.</li>
    <li>At worst, it'll be very difficult for partially-sighted people to read your content.</li>
</ul>

<p>We recommend using something else for text.</p>